  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Committee of the Red Cross (ICRC) support to the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds humanitarian support to the Occupied Palestinian Territories through the International Committee of the Red Cross (ICRC), including in response to conflict. It includes activities related to the protection of civilians; helping Palestinians in Gaza access life-saving aid and essential services; enabling families to reconnect and reunite and to recover the remains of deceased relatives; monitoring the treatment of people deprived of their liberty in relation to the conflict; helping ensure availability and access to life-saving and rehabilitative medical care; and providing support for coping with emotional trauma and addressing other mental health needs.</narrative>
  </description>
